```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Step1[1️⃣ CREATE<br/>👤 Player A stakes<br/>🎮 LP NFT] 
    
    Step2[2️⃣ JOIN<br/>👤 Player B stakes<br/>⚔️ LP NFT]
    
    Step3[3️⃣ BATTLE<br/>🎯 Track performance<br/>⏰ Wait for timer]
    
    Step4[4️⃣ WIN<br/>🏆 Best performance<br/>💰 Takes all fees]

    Step1 --> Step2 --> Step3 --> Step4

    %% Clean styling for presentations
    classDef step fill:#f8f9fa,stroke:#495057,stroke-width:4px,color:#212529,font-size:14px,font-weight:bold
    
    class Step1,Step2,Step3,Step4 step
```